    "id": "rate_half_kb_m2_r4_diagonal_c2_112_quadratic_parity_reduced_evaluation_identity",
    "title": "KoalaBear quadratic-chart parity-reduced evaluation identity",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "division-free representative for every reconstructed-row evaluation modulo the quadratic resultant",
    "statement": "Let R=U^2-VZ and P(w)=sum_i a_i w^i have degree d. The denominator-cleared evaluation C_P=sum_i a_i(-U)^i V^(d-i) is congruent modulo R to sum_j a_(2j)V^(d-j)Z^j - sum_j a_(2j+1)U V^(d-j-1)Z^j. Thus every generic quadratic-chart row evaluation has a division-free representative using at most the first power of U and roughly half the powers of V before expansion.",
